  "description": "Captured heroes Luke Skywalker and Han Solo are forced onto Jabba's prison barge and transported to the Great Pit of Carkoon, where the insatiable Sarlacc awaits. Not about to be turned into this creature's lunch, mature, in-control Luke uses his considerable Jedi skills to stage a dramatic comeback. Soon the barge is ablaze with laserfire, as Han Solo, Chewbacca and Lando Calrissian swing into action. Not about to be left out of the fight, scantily-clad Leia, brought along by Jabba, turns the tables on her bloated \"master\" by strangling him with her slave chain. Luke and his companions, including the Droids, manage to get clear of the besieged barge only seconds before it blows to pieces..."
